igatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">Please join us for this VIP event at a mystery location between 12pm and 2.30pm on Sunday 17th of May. Details will be provided to attendees as the date approaches.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">This is an exclusive event and so we ask for your discretion.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;"><b>Date:</b>&nbsp;Sunday, 17 May 2020</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; padding-right: 40px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px;"><b>Time:</b>&n